{
  "hadith_number": 35,
  "text": "On the authority of Abu Harayra, may Allah be pleased with him. He said, the messenger of Allah made the blessings and peace of Allah be upon him. He said, do not vary one another. Do not inflate prices one to another. Do not hate one another. Do not turn away from one another. And do not undercut one another. But be you, a servants of Allah, brother. But be you, a servants of Allah, brothers. Al-Muslim is the brother of a Muslim. He now that oppressors nor does he fail him. He now that lies to him nor does he hold him in contempt. Piety is right here and he pointed to his breast three times. It is evil enough for a man to hold his brother in Muslim in contempt. The whole of a Muslim for another Muslim is immeasurable. His blood, his property and his honour. It was related by Muslim.",
